elling suggestions are drawn by oculus at the top of the text menu from the checker's answers, and no native menu is drawn in a page. The find bar is a view of its own because Chromium's find counts the text of a box in the page it searches. The window background and the native theme are dark, and a page in the app with no stored theme starts on `vscode-dark-modern`.
